<title>FRANCE: ETPM wins North Sea pipeline contract.</title>
<headline>ETPM wins North Sea pipeline contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ETPM, part of Lyonnaise unit GTM Entrepose, said on Friday that it had been awarded a pipeline contract by Elf Exploration UK worth more than 2.5 billion francs.</p>
<p>&quot;The contract, worth more than 2.5 billion francs, is deemed to be one of the largest pipeline contracts awarded to date in the British section of the North Sea,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The contract concerned supplying pipelines at the Elgin-Franklin North Sea oilfield, it said.</p>
<p>Lyonnaise is merging with Suez.</p>
</text>
